        "procedure": "To a mixture of CpK (0.18 g, 1.73 mmol) and DyI2H (0.35 g, 0.84 mmol) was added 10 mL of freshly distilled THF. The mixture was stirred at room temperature in a sealed ampoule for 10 h. The pale yellow solution was separated from a colorless precipitate by filtration. Pale yellow crystals of Cp3Dy(THF) were isolated by slowly removing the solvent in vacuum and identified by matching X-ray cell parameters with a known complex.",
